            "name": "Wallet performance history",
            "description": {
              "content": "Retrieves the user's wallet performance history. Each data point is one day at midnight UTC. \n\nFor example a data point at 2022-01-01 would mean what the performance was at 2022-01-01 00:00 UTC\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
